        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Keith Morris, Rome Ramirez\n- Bands: Black Flag, Circle Jerks, Off!, Sublime with Rome, Sublime, The Vandals\n- Songs: \"We've Had Enough\"\n- Places: Fremont, California\n\nFacts:\n- Keith Morris was born on September 18, 1955.\n- Keith Morris is an American singer and songwriter.\n- Keith Morris was the frontman of the hardcore punk bands Black Flag, Circle Jerks, and Off!.\n- Rome Ramirez was born as Roman René Ramírez on June 11, 1988 in Fremont, California.\n- Rome Ramirez is an American singer and guitarist.\n- Rome Ramirez is best known for playing with Eric Wilson from Sublime and Josh Freese from The Vandals in the band Sublime with Rome.\n- The song \"We've Had Enough\" features backing vocals by Keith Morris.\n- Keith Morris was the singer of Circle Jerks and the original singer of Black Flag.",
